{"id":"b10d8a757ca4190e","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-substitution.md","title":"Proof Substitution","display":"df-proof-substitution — Proof Substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-substitution","aliases":["72-df-proof-substitution"],"display":"df-proof-substitution — Proof Substitution","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.3.5 print33/PDF45; explicit substitution of rule witnesses","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-substitution — Proof Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.3.5 print33/PDF45; explicit substitution of rule witnesses"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\">\\(\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\\)</span>；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:Q\\to Q\">\\(\\sigma:Q\\to Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:B_\\mathcal C\\to B_\\mathcal C\">\\(\\tau:B_\\mathcal C\\to B_\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为给定函数，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma[\\mathsf{Ax}]\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ax}\">\\(\\sigma[\\mathsf{Ax}]\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ax}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(\\langle\\mathsf{ax},q\\rangle)=\\langle\\mathsf{ax},\\sigma(q)\\rangle\">\\(\\tau(\\langle\\mathsf{ax},q\\rangle)=\\langle\\mathsf{ax},\\sigma(q)\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle t,w,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathsf R\">\\(\\langle t,w,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathsf R\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(\\langle t,w\\rangle)=\\langle t&#39;,w&#39;\\rangle\">\\(\\tau(\\langle t,w\\rangle)=\\langle t&#39;,w&#39;\\rangle\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle t&#39;,w&#39;,\\sigma\\circ p,\\sigma(q)\\rangle\\in\\mathsf R\">\\(\\langle t&#39;,w&#39;,\\sigma\\circ p,\\sigma(q)\\rangle\\in\\mathsf R\\)</span>。若专用于项/公式替换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 是该替换在序列相继式上的逐项作用，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 同时替换切公式及更新本征变量见证；新鲜性检查包含在此具体规则闭包条件中。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi[\\sigma,\\tau]:=\\langle D,\\prec,\\sigma\\circ\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\tau\\circ\\eta\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi[\\sigma,\\tau]:=\\langle D,\\prec,\\sigma\\circ\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\tau\\circ\\eta\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\\ \\to\\ \\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\sigma\\circ\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\tau\\circ\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\\ \\to\\ \\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\sigma\\circ\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\tau\\circ\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi[\\sigma,\\tau])=\\sigma(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi[\\sigma,\\tau])=\\sigma(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>替换必须作用在真实规则见证上。显示的规则保持条件逐节点保证变换后合法，树形及良基性不变；这是参数化构造，不是假定任意全局项替换自动保持所有本征变量条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$ 及 $\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle$ 满足 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的 $\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)$；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:Q\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:B_\\mathcal C\\to B_\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma[\\mathsf{Ax}]\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ax}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(\\langle\\mathsf{ax},q\\rangle)=\\langle\\mathsf{ax},\\sigma(q)\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle t,w,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathsf R","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(\\langle t,w\\rangle)=\\langle t',w'\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle t',w',\\sigma\\circ p,\\sigma(q)\\rangle\\in\\mathsf R","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi[\\sigma,\\tau]:=\\langle D,\\prec,\\sigma\\circ\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\tau\\circ\\eta\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\\ \\to\\ \\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\sigma\\circ\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\tau\\circ\\eta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi[\\sigma,\\tau])=\\sigma(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).","display":true}],"bytes":2016,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-substitution|df-proof-substitution — Proof Substitution]]"},{"id":"81b8ea42a64cc934","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p$ 是一个固定零元关系原子，$\\psi$ 是固定公式；$\\sigma$ 为把 $p$ 替为 $\\psi$ 的给定公式替换在相继式上的作用，$\\tau$ 是其规则见证作用，两者满足 [[72-df-proof-substitution]] 的明确闭包条件。$\\pi$ 为该演算有限证明。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-proof-substitution|df-proof-substitution — Proof Substitution]]"}],"outgoing":["81c9c855e009a6d4","d940a4cbbc0bf9c9"]}